    "A redacted recovery timeline — self-reconnects, failure reasons, and fallback state. No browsing history or domains are included.": {
      "comment": "Bug-report preview section title/purpose (BugReportBundle, shown via .lavaLocalized).",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A redacted recovery timeline — automatic reconnects, failure reasons, and fallback state. No browsing history or domains are included."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eine bereinigte Wiederherstellungs-Chronik – automatische Neuverbindungen, Fehlerursachen und Ersatz-Status. Kein Browserverlauf und keine Domains sind enthalten."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Una cronología de recuperación censurada: reconexiones automáticas, motivos de fallo y estado del DNS de respaldo. No se incluye historial de navegación ni dominios."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Une chronologie de récupération expurgée : reconnexions automatiques, causes d’échec et état de secours. Aucun historique de navigation ni domaine n’est inclus."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Una cronologia di ripristino oscurata: riconnessioni automatiche, cause degli errori e stato del DNS di riserva. Non include cronologia di navigazione né domini."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "編集済みの復旧タイムライン（自動再接続、失敗の理由、フォールバック状態）。閲覧履歴やドメインは含まれません。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "민감 정보를 가린 복구 타임라인 — 자동 재연결, 실패 원인, 대체 상태. 검색 기록이나 도메인은 포함되지 않아요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uma linha do tempo de recuperação editada — reconexões automáticas, motivos de falha e estado do DNS alternativo. Não inclui histórico de navegação nem domínios."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "经过脱敏的恢复时间线——自动重新连接、失败原因和备用状态。不含浏览记录或域名。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "經過去識別化的復原時間軸——自動重新連線、失敗原因與備援狀態。不含瀏覽記錄或網域。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A selected blocklist is no longer available. Choose another list and try again.": {
