    "A site you allow here always gets through, even if a blocklist would block it. Only add sites you fully trust.": {
      "comment": "Caution under the allowed-exceptions list. 'allow'/'blocklist' should match the catalog's Allowed Exceptions / blocklist renderings. Plain, reassuring tone.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eine erlaubte Ausnahme kommt immer durch, auch wenn eine Blockliste sie blockieren würde. Füge nur Domains hinzu, denen du voll vertraust."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "An allowed exception always gets through, even if a blocklist would block it. Add only domains you fully trust."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Una excepción permitida siempre pasa, aunque una lista de bloqueo la bloquee. Añade solo dominios en los que confíes plenamente."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Une exception autorisée passe toujours, même si une liste de blocage la bloquerait. N’ajoutez que des domaines auxquels vous faites entièrement confiance."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un’eccezione consentita passa sempre, anche se una lista di blocco la bloccherebbe. Aggiungi solo domini di cui ti fidi pienamente."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "許可する例外は、ブロックリストが対象にしていても必ず通過します。完全に信頼できるドメインだけを追加してください。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "허용 예외는 차단 목록이 막더라도 항상 통과해요. 완전히 믿을 수 있는 도메인만 추가하세요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uma exceção permitida sempre passa, mesmo que uma lista de bloqueio a bloqueie. Adicione apenas domínios em que você confia totalmente."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "允许的例外一律放行，即使拦截列表会拦截它。请只添加你完全信任的域名。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "允許的例外一律會通過，即使封鎖清單會封鎖它。請只新增你完全信任的網域。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
