    "Lava will show App & Device, VPN Status, Tunnel Lifecycle, Network & Resolver Health, Filter Snapshot, and Local Activity Summary when a local summary is ready.": {
      "comment": "Release app UI string. Keep placeholders and product names intact.",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sobald eine Zusammenfassung bereit ist, zeigt Lava Infos zu deiner App und deinem Gerät, den Schutzstatus, Verbindungs- und Schutzereignisse, den Verbindungszustand, deinen aktiven Filter und die Filterzähler."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lava will show your app and device info, protection status, connection and protection events, connection health, your active filter, and filtering counts when a summary is ready."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lava affichera les infos de votre app et de votre appareil, l’état de la protection, les événements de connexion et de protection, l’état de la connexion, votre filtre actif et les compteurs de filtrage dès qu’un résumé sera prêt."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "概要の準備ができると、Lavaはアプリとデバイスの情報、保護ステータス、接続と保護のイベント、接続の状態、使用中のフィルター、フィルタリング件数を表示します。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "摘要准备就绪后，Lava 会显示 App 与设备信息、防护状态、连接与防护事件、连接健康状况、你正在使用的筛选器以及筛选计数。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "摘要準備好後，Lava 會顯示 App 與裝置資訊、防護狀態、連線與防護事件、連線健康狀態、你使用中的篩選器，以及篩選計數。"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lava mostrará la información de tu app y dispositivo, el estado de la protección, los eventos de conexión y protección, el estado de la conexión, tu filtro activo y los recuentos de filtrado cuando haya un resumen listo."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "요약이 준비되면 Lava가 앱 및 기기 정보, 보호 상태, 연결 및 보호 이벤트, 연결 상태, 사용 중인 필터, 필터링 횟수를 보여 줘요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O Lava mostrará as informações do app e do dispositivo, o status da proteção, os eventos de conexão e proteção, a saúde da conexão, o seu filtro ativo e as contagens de filtragem quando um resumo estiver pronto."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quando un riepilogo sarà pronto, Lava mostrerà le info su app e dispositivo, lo stato della protezione, gli eventi di connessione e protezione, lo stato della connessione, il filtro attivo e i conteggi del filtraggio."
          }
        }
      }
    },
