    "Lava protects this device first. Once setup is done, scan the same QR code again to review the shared filter.": {
      "comment": "Body of the pre-onboarding notice. Must make clear the same card can simply be scanned again; nothing was kept.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lava schützt zuerst dieses Gerät. Scanne nach der Einrichtung denselben QR-Code erneut, um den geteilten Filter zu prüfen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lava protects this device first. Once setup is done, scan the same QR code again to review the shared filter."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lava protege este dispositivo primero. Cuando termines la configuración, vuelve a escanear el mismo código QR para revisar el filtro compartido."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lava protège d’abord cet appareil. Une fois la configuration terminée, rescannez le même code QR pour examiner le filtre partagé."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lava protegge prima questo dispositivo. Al termine della configurazione, scansiona di nuovo lo stesso codice QR per esaminare il filtro condiviso."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lavaはまずこのデバイスを保護します。設定が終わったら、同じQRコードをもう一度スキャンして共有フィルターを確認してください。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lava는 이 기기를 먼저 보호합니다. 설정을 마친 뒤 같은 QR 코드를 다시 스캔해 공유된 필터를 확인하세요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O Lava protege este dispositivo primeiro. Depois de concluir a configuração, leia o mesmo código QR novamente para revisar o filtro compartilhado."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lava 会先保护这台设备。完成设置后，再扫一次同一个 QR 码即可查看该共享筛选器。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lava 會先保護這台裝置。完成設定後，再掃一次同一個 QR 碼即可查看該共享篩選器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
