    "Allowed exceptions include subdomains and can let blocked sites through. Review every entry.": {
      "comment": "Filter review, sharing or import. Keep user filter names verbatim. Review is read-only; confirmation saves the displayed changes.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Allowed exceptions include subdomains and can let blocked domains through. Review every entry."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "許可する例外にはサブドメインも含まれ、ブロック対象のドメインを通すことがあります。各項目を確認してください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "允許的例外也包含子網域，可能讓已封鎖的網域通過。請逐一檢閱。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "允许的例外也包含子域名，可能让已拦截的域名通过。请逐项检查。"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Erlaubte Ausnahmen schließen Subdomains ein und können blockierte Domains durchlassen. Prüfe jeden Eintrag."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les exceptions autorisées incluent les sous-domaines et peuvent laisser passer des domaines bloqués. Vérifiez chaque entrée."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Las excepciones permitidas incluyen subdominios y pueden dejar pasar dominios bloqueados. Revisa cada entrada."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "허용 예외에는 하위 도메인이 포함되며 차단된 도메인을 통과시킬 수 있어요. 모든 항목을 검토하세요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Exceções permitidas incluem subdomínios e podem liberar domínios bloqueados. Revise cada entrada."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le eccezioni consentite includono i sottodomini e possono far passare domini bloccati. Controlla ogni voce."
          }
        }
      }
    },
