    "It all starts here, on your device. Before it opens anything, it asks one question: where does this website live?": {
      "comment": "Explore narration for one step. Keep the story conversational, natural, and easy to follow. Existing audio clips need regeneration to match this copy.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It all starts here, on your device. Before it opens anything, it asks one question: where does this website live?"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Alles beginnt hier, auf deinem Gerät. Bevor es etwas öffnet, fragt es: Wo ist diese Website zu finden?"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Todo empieza aquí, en tu dispositivo. Antes de abrir nada, hace una pregunta: ¿dónde está este sitio?"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tout commence ici, sur votre appareil. Avant d’ouvrir quoi que ce soit, il demande : où se trouve ce site ?"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tutto inizia qui, sul tuo dispositivo. Prima di aprire qualsiasi cosa, fa una domanda: dove si trova questo sito?"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "すべてはここ、デバイスから始まります。何かを開く前に、「このサイトはどこにあるの？」と尋ねます。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "모든 건 여기, 기기에서 시작돼요. 무엇이든 열기 전에 사이트가 어디 있는지부터 물어요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tudo começa aqui, no seu dispositivo. Antes de abrir qualquer coisa, ele faz uma pergunta: onde fica este site?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一切都从这里开始，就在你的设备上。打开任何内容前，它会先问一个问题：这个网站在哪里？"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一切都從這裡開始，就在你的裝置上。開啟任何內容前，它會先問一個問題：這個網站在哪裡？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Then, if VPN chaining is on, your request travels through your VPN on its way to DNS.": {
      "comment": "Explore narration for one step. Keep the story conversational, natural, and easy to follow. Existing audio clips need regeneration to match this copy.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Then, if VPN chaining is on, your request travels through your VPN on its way to DNS."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ist die VPN-Verkettung eingeschaltet, läuft deine Anfrage danach über dein VPN weiter zum DNS."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Luego, si el encadenamiento VPN está activado, la solicitud pasa por tu VPN de camino al DNS."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ensuite, si le chaînage VPN est activé, votre requête passe par votre VPN avant de rejoindre le DNS."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Poi, se il concatenamento VPN è attivato, la richiesta passa dalla tua VPN prima di arrivare al DNS."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "次に、VPNチェーンがオンなら、リクエストはVPNを通ってDNSへ向かいます。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "그다음, VPN 체이닝이 켜져 있으면 요청은 VPN을 거쳐 DNS로 가요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Depois, se o encadeamento de VPN estiver ativado, a solicitação passa pela sua VPN a caminho do DNS."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "接着，如果 VPN 串联已开启，请求会先经过你的 VPN，再前往 DNS。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "接著，如果 VPN 串接已開啟，請求會先經過你的 VPN，再前往 DNS。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "And last comes DNS. You get to choose who answers your device’s questions.": {
      "comment": "Explore narration for one step. Keep the story conversational, natural, and easy to follow. Existing audio clips need regeneration to match this copy.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "And last comes DNS. You get to choose who answers your device’s questions."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zuletzt kommt das DNS. Du entscheidest, wer die Fragen deines Geräts beantwortet."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Y por último, el DNS. Tú eliges quién responde a las preguntas de tu dispositivo."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Et enfin, le DNS. Vous choisissez qui répond aux questions de votre appareil."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "E per ultimo c’è il DNS. Sei tu a scegliere chi risponde alle domande del tuo dispositivo."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "そして最後はDNSです。デバイスの質問にどこが答えるかは、自分で選べます。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "마지막은 DNS예요. 기기의 질문에 누가 답할지는 직접 고를 수 있어요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "E, por último, vem o DNS. Você escolhe quem responde às perguntas do seu dispositivo."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最后一站是 DNS。你可以自己选择由谁来回答设备的问题。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最後一站是 DNS。你可以自己選擇由誰來回答裝置的問題。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This time, your filter sees that this website is allowed and lets the request continue.": {
      "comment": "Explore narration for one step. Keep the story conversational, natural, and easy to follow. Existing audio clips need regeneration to match this copy.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This time, your filter sees that this website is allowed and lets the request continue."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diesmal sieht dein Filter, dass diese Website erlaubt ist, und lässt die Anfrage passieren."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Esta vez, tu filtro ve que este sitio está permitido y deja que la solicitud continúe."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cette fois, votre filtre voit que ce site est autorisé et laisse la requête poursuivre sa route."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Questa volta il tuo filtro vede che questo sito è consentito e lascia proseguire la richiesta."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "フィルターは許可されたサイトだと気づき、今回はリクエストをそのまま通します。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "이번에는 필터가 허용된 사이트라는 걸 알아보고 요청을 통과시켜요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Desta vez, seu filtro vê que este site está permitido e deixa a solicitação seguir."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这一次，筛选器发现这个网站已被允许，就让请求继续前进。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這一次，篩選器發現這個網站已被允許，就讓請求繼續前進。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "From here, the request travels through your VPN if chaining is on, then heads to DNS.": {
      "comment": "Explore narration for one step. Keep the story conversational, natural, and easy to follow. Existing audio clips need regeneration to match this copy.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
