    },
    "Every request takes a journey along the path you set. Let’s look at each step.": {
      "comment": "Explore narration for one step. Keep the story conversational, natural, and easy to follow. Existing audio clips need regeneration to match this copy.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Every request takes a journey along the path you set. Let’s look at each step."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jede Anfrage folgt dem Weg, den du festgelegt hast. Schauen wir uns jeden Schritt an."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Toda solicitud hace un recorrido por la ruta que has configurado. Veamos cada paso."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chaque requête suit le chemin que vous avez défini. Voyons chaque étape."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ogni richiesta segue il percorso che hai impostato. Vediamo i passaggi uno per uno."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "リクエストはどれも、設定した経路をたどって進みます。ステップをひとつずつ見てみましょう。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "모든 요청은 직접 설정한 경로를 따라 이동해요. 한 단계씩 살펴볼게요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Toda solicitação percorre o caminho que você definiu. Vamos ver cada etapa."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每个请求都会沿着你设置的路径走一趟。一起来看看每个步骤吧。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每個請求都會沿著你設定的路徑走一趟。一起來看看每個步驟吧。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "First comes your filter. It checks each request against your lists, then lets it through or stops it here.": {
      "comment": "Explore narration for one step. Keep the story conversational, natural, and easy to follow. Existing audio clips need regeneration to match this copy.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "First comes your filter. It checks each request against your lists, then lets it through or stops it here."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zuerst kommt dein Filter. Er prüft jede Anfrage anhand deiner Listen und lässt sie durch oder hält sie hier auf."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Primero viene tu filtro. Compara cada solicitud con tus listas y la deja pasar o la detiene aquí."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "D’abord, votre filtre. Il compare chaque requête à vos listes, puis la laisse passer ou l’arrête ici."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Prima c’è il tuo filtro. Confronta ogni richiesta con le tue liste, poi la lascia passare o la ferma qui."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "まずはフィルターです。リクエストをリストと照らし合わせ、通すか、ここで止めるかを決めます。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "가장 먼저 필터를 만나요. 필터는 요청을 내 목록과 비교해 통과시키거나 여기서 막아요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Primeiro vem seu filtro. Ele compara cada solicitação com suas listas e a deixa passar ou a interrompe aqui."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "首先是你的筛选器。它会对照你的列表检查每个请求，再决定放行，还是在这里拦下。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "首先是你的篩選器。它會對照你的清單檢查每個請求，再決定放行，還是在這裡擋下。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Let’s try a website you’ve blocked. First, your device sends the request to your filter.": {
      "comment": "Explore narration for one step. Keep the story conversational, natural, and easy to follow. Existing audio clips need regeneration to match this copy.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Let’s try a website you’ve blocked. First, your device sends the request to your filter."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Probieren wir eine Website aus, die du blockiert hast. Zuerst schickt dein Gerät die Anfrage an deinen Filter."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Probemos un sitio que has bloqueado. Primero, tu dispositivo envía la solicitud a tu filtro."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Essayons un site que vous avez bloqué. D’abord, votre appareil envoie la requête à votre filtre."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Proviamo con un sito che hai bloccato. Per prima cosa, il dispositivo invia la richiesta al tuo filtro."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ブロックしたサイトを開いてみましょう。まず、デバイスがリクエストをフィルターへ送ります。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "차단한 사이트를 열어 볼게요. 먼저 기기가 요청을 필터로 보내요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vamos testar um site que você bloqueou. Primeiro, o dispositivo envia a solicitação ao seu filtro."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "我们来试试一个你拦截的网站。首先，设备会把请求发给你的筛选器。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "我們來試試一個你封鎖的網站。首先，裝置會把請求傳給你的篩選器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your filter sees that this website is blocked and stops the request right here. It never reaches DNS.": {
      "comment": "Explore narration for one step. Keep the story conversational, natural, and easy to follow. Existing audio clips need regeneration to match this copy.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your filter sees that this website is blocked and stops the request right here. It never reaches DNS."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dein Filter sieht, dass diese Website blockiert ist, und hält die Anfrage hier auf. Sie erreicht das DNS nie."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu filtro ve que este sitio está bloqueado y detiene la solicitud aquí mismo. Nunca llega al DNS."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Votre filtre voit que ce site est bloqué et arrête la requête ici même. Elle n’atteint jamais le DNS."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il tuo filtro vede che questo sito è bloccato e ferma la richiesta proprio qui. Non arriva mai al DNS."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "フィルターはブロックされたサイトだと気づき、ここでリクエストを止めます。DNSには届きません。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "필터가 차단된 사이트라는 걸 알아보고 요청을 바로 여기서 막아요. DNS에는 닿지 않아요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Seu filtro vê que este site está bloqueado e interrompe a solicitação aqui mesmo. Ela nunca chega ao DNS."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "筛选器发现这个网站已被拦截，就在这里拦下请求，DNS 完全不会收到。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "篩選器發現這個網站已被封鎖，就在這裡擋下請求，DNS 完全不會收到。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Now let’s try a website you’ve allowed. The request goes to your filter, just like before.": {
      "comment": "Explore narration for one step. Keep the story conversational, natural, and easy to follow. Existing audio clips need regeneration to match this copy.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Now let’s try a website you’ve allowed. The request goes to your filter, just like before."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Probieren wir jetzt eine Website aus, die du erlaubt hast. Die Anfrage geht wie zuvor an deinen Filter."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ahora probemos un sitio que has permitido. La solicitud va a tu filtro, igual que antes."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
