    "In iOS 27, Connectivity Assist replaces Wi-Fi Assist. It helps keep you online when Wi-Fi is weak, but it can also retry websites blocked by Lava over cellular, weakening filtering on Wi-Fi.": {
      "comment": "User-visible: LavaDNSPatchContent: LavaSettingsIntroduction/LavaSectionFooterLink/LavaSetupSection(title+steps)/LavaSetupAction all localize internally via lavaLocalized | LavaNativePageContent.swift; DNS patch for iOS 27 page",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In iOS 27, Connectivity Assist replaces Wi-Fi Assist. It helps keep you online when Wi-Fi is weak, but it can also retry websites blocked by Lava over cellular, weakening filtering on Wi-Fi."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In iOS 27 ersetzt die „Verbindungshilfe“ die bisherige „WLAN-Unterstützung“. Sie hält dich bei schwachem WLAN online, kann aber von Lava blockierte Websites erneut über Mobilfunk aufrufen und so die Filterung im WLAN schwächen."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "En iOS 27, Asistencia de conectividad sustituye a Asistencia para Wi-Fi. Te ayuda a seguir conectado cuando la señal Wi-Fi es débil, pero también puede reintentar por datos móviles los sitios que Lava bloquea, lo que debilita el filtrado en Wi-Fi."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dans iOS 27, l’Assistance à la connectivité remplace l’Assistance Wi-Fi. Elle vous aide à rester en ligne quand le Wi-Fi est faible, mais elle peut aussi réessayer d’accéder via le réseau cellulaire aux sites bloqués par Lava, ce qui affaiblit le filtrage en Wi-Fi."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In iOS 27, Assistenza connettività sostituisce Assistenza Wi-Fi. Ti aiuta a restare online quando il Wi-Fi è debole, ma può anche riprovare tramite rete cellulare i siti bloccati da Lava, indebolendo il filtraggio su Wi-Fi."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iOS 27では、Wi-Fiアシストに代わって接続アシストが導入されました。Wi-Fiの電波が弱いときもオンラインを保ちやすくなりますが、Lavaがブロックしたサイトへの接続をモバイル通信で再試行することもあり、Wi-Fi使用中のフィルタリングが弱まります。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iOS 27에서는 연결 지원이 Wi-Fi 지원을 대체해요. Wi-Fi 신호가 약할 때 연결을 유지해 주지만, Lava가 차단한 사이트를 셀룰러로 다시 시도할 수도 있어서 Wi-Fi에서 필터링이 약해져요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No iOS 27, a Assistência de Conectividade substitui a Assistência Wi-Fi. Ela ajuda a manter você conectado quando o Wi-Fi está fraco, mas também pode tentar abrir pela rede celular sites bloqueados pelo Lava, enfraquecendo a filtragem no Wi-Fi."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 iOS 27 中，“连接助理”取代了“无线局域网助理”。它能在 Wi-Fi 信号弱时帮你保持联网，但也可能通过蜂窝网络重新尝试访问被 Lava 拦截的网站，从而削弱连接 Wi-Fi 时的筛选效果。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 iOS 27 中，「連線輔助」取代了「Wi-Fi 輔助」。它能在 Wi-Fi 訊號不佳時幫你保持連線，但也可能改用行動網路重新嘗試連上被 Lava 封鎖的網站，削弱 Wi-Fi 上的篩選效果。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
