          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這會從這台裝置移除已儲存的網域記錄。篩選計數和網路活動不受影響。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This removes unearned Lava Guard progress from this device. Earned Lava Guards stay unlocked.": {
      "comment": "User-visible: bridge confirmations → RN Alert.alert() (presentation.tsx localizes title/message by exact key) — Privacy/Activity \"Clear …\" confirmations | PrivacySecuritySettingsView.swift; RN screen (runtime sweep)",
