    "Vendored upstream source, compiled from a pinned toolchain into a static library that is linked into the app's packet-tunnel extension in every build, whether or not chained upstream is turned on. No code is downloaded at runtime.": {
      "comment": "Lava-authored legal attribution explanation; preserve provider and license names. Upstream license texts are reproduced verbatim separately.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vendored upstream source, compiled from a pinned toolchain into a static library that is linked into the app's packet-tunnel extension in every build, whether or not chained upstream is turned on. No code is downloaded at runtime."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同梱した上流ソースを固定したツールチェーンで静的ライブラリにコンパイルし、VPNチェーンの有効・無効にかかわらず毎回アプリのパケットトンネル拡張にリンクします。実行時にコードをダウンロードしません。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "將內含的上游原始碼以固定工具鏈編譯為靜態程式庫，在每次建置時連結至 App 的封包通道延伸功能，無論是否啟用上游串接。執行時不會下載程式碼。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将内含的上游源代码以固定工具链编译为静态库，在每次构建时链接到 App 的数据包隧道扩展，无论是否启用上游串联。运行时不会下载代码。"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mitgelieferter Upstream-Quellcode, mit einer festgelegten Toolchain zu einer statischen Bibliothek kompiliert, die in jedem Build mit der Paket-Tunnel-Erweiterung der App verknüpft wird, unabhängig davon, ob die Upstream-Kopplung aktiviert ist. Zur Laufzeit wird kein Code heruntergeladen."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Code source amont inclus, compilé avec une chaîne d’outils figée en bibliothèque statique et lié à l’extension de tunnel de paquets de l’application à chaque compilation, que le chaînage amont soit activé ou non. Aucun code n’est téléchargé à l’exécution."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Código fuente del proyecto incluido, compilado con herramientas de versión fija en una biblioteca estática enlazada a la extensión de túnel de paquetes de la app en cada compilación, esté o no activado el encadenamiento. No se descarga código durante la ejecución."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "포함된 업스트림 소스를 고정된 도구 모음으로 정적 라이브러리로 컴파일하여 업스트림 연결 활성화 여부와 관계없이 모든 빌드에서 앱의 패킷 터널 확장에 연결합니다. 실행 중에는 코드를 다운로드하지 않습니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Código-fonte incluído, compilado com ferramentas de versão fixa em uma biblioteca estática vinculada à extensão de túnel de pacotes do app em cada compilação, com ou sem encadeamento ativado. Nenhum código é baixado durante a execução."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Codice sorgente upstream incluso, compilato con una toolchain fissa in una libreria statica collegata all’estensione tunnel di pacchetti dell’app a ogni build, indipendentemente dall’attivazione della concatenazione. Nessun codice viene scaricato durante l’esecuzione."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cryptographic core — Noise handshake and transport encryption — for a user-supplied WireGuard upstream. No logo or provider branding is shown.": {
      "comment": "Lava-authored legal attribution explanation; preserve provider and license names. Upstream license texts are reproduced verbatim separately.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
